{"speciesId":15,"names":{"fr":"Dardargnan","es":"Beedrill","en":"Beedrill","ja":"スピアー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Flies at high speed and attacks using its large venomous stingers on its forelegs and tail."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Flies at high speed and attacks using its large venomous stingers on its forelegs and tail."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"It has 3 poisonous stingers on its forelegs and its tail. They are used to jab its enemy repeatedly."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It can take down any opponent with its powerful poi­ son stingers. It sometimes attacks in swarms."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It has three poison barbs. The barb on its tail secretes the most powerful poison."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It uses sharp, poisonous stings to defeat prey, then takes the victim back to its nest for food."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"BEEDRILL is extremely territorial. No one should ever approach its nest - this is for their own safety. If angered, they will attack in a furious swarm."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"BEEDRILL is extremely territorial. No one should ever approach its nest - this is for their own safety. If angered, they will attack in a furious swarm."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A BEEDRILL is extremely territorial. For safety reasons, no one should ever approach its nest. If angered, they will attack in a swarm."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"May appear in a swarm. Flies at violent speeds, all the while stabbing with the toxic stinger on its rear."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It flies at high speed and attacks using the large venomous stingers on its forelegs and tail."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It can take down any opponent with its powerful poison stingers. It sometimes attacks in swarms."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It has three poison barbs. The barb on its tail secretes the most powerful poison."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il virevolte rapidement autour de l’ennemi et frappe de son dard empoisonné avant de décamper."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il virevolte rapidement autour de l’ennemi et frappe de son dard empoisonné avant de décamper."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se sert de ses trois aiguillons empoisonnés pour attaquer sans relâche ses adversaires."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Tiene 3 aguijones venenosos en sus patas y cola. Suelen pinchar a sus enemigos repetidas veces."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It has three poisonous stingers on its forelegs and its tail. They are used to jab its enemy repeatedly."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"両手と お尻にある ３本の 毒針で 相手を 刺して 刺して 刺しまくって 攻撃する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On le voit souvent voler dans un essaim. Il vole très rapidement, piquant sans cesse ses adversaires de son dard toxique."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Puede aparecer en enjambres volando a gran velocidad. Suele usar el venenoso aguijón inferior para atacar."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"May appear in a swarm. Flies at violent speeds, all the while stabbing with the toxic stinger on its rear."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"集団で 現れることもある。 猛スピードで 飛び回り お尻の 毒針で 刺しまくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dardargnan est extrêmement possessif. Il vaut mieux ne pas toucher son nid si on veut éviter d’avoir des ennuis. Lorsqu’ils sont en colère, ces Pokémon attaquent en masse."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Los Beedrill defienden su territorio a toda costa. No es conveniente acercarse a su colmena, por seguridad. Si se les molesta, todo un enjambre atacará ferozmente."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Beedrill is extremely territorial. No one should ever approach its nest—this is for their own safety. If angered, they will attack in a furious swarm."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"縄張り意識が とても 強いので スピアーの すみかには 近づかない ほうが 身の ためだ。 怒ると 集団で 襲って くるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dardargnan est extrêmement possessif. Il vaut mieux ne pas toucher son nid si on veut éviter d’avoir des ennuis. Lorsqu’ils sont en colère, ces Pokémon attaquent en masse."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Los Beedrill defienden su territorio a toda costa. No es conveniente acercarse a su colmena, por seguridad. Si se les molesta, todo un enjambre atacará ferozmente."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Beedrill is extremely territorial. No one should ever approach its nest—this is for their own safety. If angered, they will attack in a furious swarm."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"縄張り意識が とても 強いので スピアーの すみかには 近づかない ほうが 身の ためだ。 怒ると 集団で 襲って くるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-p